{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14807","headline":"和太常李主簿秋中山下别墅即事 · 卢纶","name":"和太常李主簿秋中山下别墅即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清秋来几时，宋玉已先知。\n旷朗霞映竹，澄明山满池。\n葺桥双鹤赴，收果衆猨随。\n韶乐方今奏，云林徒蔽亏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}